Is It Game-Key Card Or Not — data license
=========================================

The code in this repository is released under the MIT License (see LICENSE at the root).
The data in this directory has its own license:

This database (data/skus.yaml and data/physical_release.yaml, and the project's own fields in the other files
of this directory) is made available under the Open Database License:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Any rights in individual contents of the database are
licensed under the Database Contents License: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

In short (the legal text is the one at the links):
- You may copy, distribute and use the database, including commercially.
- You must attribute it: "Is It Game-Key Card Or Not, ODbL 1.0", with a link to
  https://github.com/rherranzg/isitgamekeycardornot.
- If you publish a derived database, it must also be released under the ODbL.
- A website, chart or report made from the data (a "Produced Work") only requires attribution.

Contributions to the data are accepted under this same license.

Not covered by this license
---------------------------
- IGDB metadata. data/titles.yaml and data/excluded_titles.yaml (and the local, git-ignored
  data/igdb_catalog.yaml) contain metadata from IGDB (https://www.igdb.com): ids, names, publishers and
  release dates. It is not this project's data; it is subject to the terms of IGDB and Twitch Developer
  Services and is not relicensed under the ODbL.
- Quoted excerpts. The comments in the YAML files quote short passages from third-party sources (press
  articles, official pages, retailer listings) to show what backs each entry. Those passages belong to
  their authors, are included only as citations, and are not relicensed under the ODbL.
